Below 68rem the wordmark folds to the mark and its cursor; the name is still read out. 'Here' is a latched #26313a cell whose 2px steel cap and 7px lamp sit on the bar's rule. On the phone's tab bar the same cell has the cap on top.

Chat keeps the line from her screen to the lit ring at the box. The family's lines are square steel plates flush right, with 'Sam · 19:47' in the head, and the day is named once. On the phone the track folds away:
- her 1.6rem screen stands beside her bubble's head;
